[76,"Casa de Lina — Cafetería y Pupusería","Casa de Lina — Cafetería y Pupusería","Coffee / Food","San Vicente","San Vicente",13.641,-88.785,"🫓","Cafeteria and pupuseria in San Vicente. Listed contact: +503 6844-9759; casadelinaelsalvador@gmail.com. Open Friday, Saturday and Sunday, 4–8:30 PM. Contact the business through Instagram to confirm its menu and arrival instructions. Directions open the Google Maps listing supplied for this business; the map marker is approximate for San Vicente.","Cafetería y pupusería en San Vicente. Contacto publicado: +503 6844-9759; casadelinaelsalvador@gmail.com. Abierto viernes, sábado y domingo de 4:00 a 8:30 p. m. Consulta por Instagram el menú e indicaciones de llegada. El enlace de indicaciones abre la ficha de Google Maps proporcionada para este negocio; el marcador del mapa es aproximado de San Vicente."],
[75,"Artemisa Café — Bernal","Artemisa Café — Bernal","Coffee / Food","San Salvador","Mejicanos",13.7255625,-89.2166875,"☕","Cafeteria and bistro at Texaco Bernal, Mejicanos, serving coffee, brunch, hot and cold drinks, and desserts. Location code: PQGM+68H. Bernal WhatsApp: +503 7841-5586. The branch website lists 7 AM–8 PM; other directories show different hours, so confirm directly before visiting. Browse the branch menu online.","Cafetería y bistro en Texaco Bernal, Mejicanos, con café, brunch, bebidas calientes y frías, y postres. Código de ubicación: PQGM+68H. WhatsApp Bernal: +503 7841-5586. El sitio de la sucursal publica 7:00 a. m.–8:00 p. m.; otros directorios muestran horarios distintos, por lo que conviene confirmar directamente. Consulta el menú de esta sucursal en línea."],
[74,"Alquimia Coffee — San Benito","Alquimia Coffee — San Benito","Coffee / Food","San Salvador","San Benito",13.69288,-89.24273,"☕","Specialty coffee shop and roastery founded by Federico Bolaños, ranked third in The World’s 100 Best Coffee Shops 2026. Known for carefully prepared coffee and creative drinks. San Benito location: Calle Circunvalación #294, San Salvador. Listed phone: +503 7672-1507. Recent Waze listings show daily hours of 7 AM–8 PM; confirm current hours and menu via Instagram.","Cafetería de especialidad y tostaduría fundada por Federico Bolaños, tercer puesto en The World’s 100 Best Coffee Shops 2026. Destaca por la preparación cuidada del café y bebidas creativas. Sucursal San Benito: Calle Circunvalación #294, San Salvador. Teléfono publicado: +503 7672-1507. Waze indica recientemente horario diario de 7:00 a. m. a 8:00 p. m.; confirma horario y menú en Instagram."],
[73,"Comedor Yolan","Comedor Yolan","Coffee / Food","Cuscatlán","San Rafael Cedros",13.7292241,-88.8832697,"🍲","Family-run Salvadoran eatery founded in 1962, known for wood-fired breakfasts, stews, grilled chicken and fried fish. Located in San Rafael Cedros near the Ilobasco turnoff. Listed phone: +503 6313-2649. Waze lists daily hours of 6 AM–3:45 PM; confirm before visiting.","Comedor familiar salvadoreño fundado en 1962, conocido por desayunos, guisos, gallina asada y pescado frito preparados al fuego de leña. En San Rafael Cedros, cerca del desvío a Ilobasco. Teléfono publicado: +503 6313-2649. Waze indica horario diario de 6:00 a. m. a 3:45 p. m.; confirma antes de visitar."],
[72,"Puerto Barillas Monkey Sanctuary","Santuario de Monos de Puerto Barillas","Nature","Usulután","Bahía de Jiquilisco",13.26164,-88.49108,"🐒","Spider monkey sanctuary experience arranged through Puerto Barillas in Jiquilisco Bay, Usulután. Join a walking tour to observe the monkeys in their forest surroundings. Published visiting hours: daily 8 AM–3 PM. Reservations: +503 7039-2001; info@puertobarillas.com. Confirm tour prices, availability, meeting point and access requirements before travelling. The map marker points to Puerto Barillas lodge, where visitors can arrange the sanctuary tour. Kayaking, birdwatching and cacao tours are also offered separately.","Experiencia en el santuario de monos araña coordinada con Puerto Barillas, en la Bahía de Jiquilisco, Usulután. Participa en una caminata para observar los monos en su entorno de bosque. Horario publicado: todos los días de 8:00 a. m. a 3:00 p. m. Reservas: +503 7039-2001; info@puertobarillas.com. Confirma tarifas, disponibilidad, punto de encuentro y requisitos de acceso antes de viajar. El marcador señala el lodge de Puerto Barillas, donde se coordina la visita al santuario. También se ofrecen por separado kayak, observación de aves y recorridos de cacao."],
[71,"Puerto Barillas — Marina & Lodge","Puerto Barillas — Marina y Lodge","Hotel","Usulután","Bahía de Jiquilisco",13.26164,-88.49108,"🛶","Nature retreat and lodge on a mangrove channel in Jiquilisco Bay, Usulután. Stay in treehouses for up to four people or two-bedroom apartments for up to six with equipped kitchens. Experiences include guided kayaking, birdwatching, boat and pontoon tours, cacao plantation tours and visits to the spider monkey sanctuary. Reservations: +503 7039-2001; info@puertobarillas.com. Road access begins at km 108.5 of the CA-2 coastal highway. Confirm rates, tour availability and arrival directions directly. Treehouses have spiral stairs and are not recommended for guests with mobility difficulties.","Refugio natural y alojamiento junto a un canal de manglar en la Bahía de Jiquilisco, Usulután. Casas en los árboles para hasta cuatro personas y apartamentos de dos dormitorios para hasta seis, con cocina equipada. Experiencias: kayak guiado, observación de aves, paseos en lancha y pontón, recorridos por la plantación de cacao y visitas al santuario de monos araña. Reservas: +503 7039-2001; info@puertobarillas.com. Acceso terrestre desde el km 108.5 de la carretera del Litoral CA-2. Confirma tarifas, disponibilidad e indicaciones directamente. Las casas en los árboles tienen escaleras de caracol y no se recomiendan para personas con dificultades de movilidad."],
[70,"San Blas Beach","Playa San Blas","Water","La Libertad","Surf City",13.48791,-89.35848,"🏖️","Black volcanic-sand beach in Surf City, about 3 km west of Puerto de La Libertad. Enjoy beach walks, sunsets, beach clubs and nearby accommodation. Surf schools and board rentals serve the area; beach breaks and rocky sections offer different levels of difficulty, so ask local instructors about conditions. Access via the Camino a Surf City bypass and the coastal highway near km 39½. Parking and private facilities may charge separate fees.","Playa de arena negra volcánica en Surf City, a unos 3 km al oeste del Puerto de La Libertad. Disfruta de caminatas, atardeceres, clubes de playa y alojamientos cercanos. Hay escuelas de surf y alquiler de tablas; las rompientes de arena y zonas rocosas presentan distintos niveles de dificultad, por lo que conviene consultar las condiciones con instructores locales. Acceso por el bypass Camino a Surf City y la carretera del Litoral, cerca del km 39½. El parqueo y las instalaciones privadas pueden tener tarifas separadas."],
[69,"Café Urraca","Café Urraca","Coffee / Food","La Libertad","Surf City",13.48687,-89.34397,"☕","Coffee stop at The Spot Plaza in Surf City, La Libertad. Address: Centro Comercial The Spot, Final a la Calle a Surf City, Surf City 1507. Open daily 8 AM–4 PM, according to the official menu page. Browse the bilingual menu and confirm current offerings through the café’s website or Instagram.","Cafetería en The Spot Plaza, Surf City, La Libertad. Dirección: Centro Comercial The Spot, Final a la Calle a Surf City, Surf City 1507. Abierto todos los días de 8:00 a. m. a 4:00 p. m., según el menú oficial. Consulta el menú bilingüe y confirma la oferta vigente en el sitio web o Instagram del café."],
[68,"La Burbuja — Glamping & Eco Lodge","La Burbuja — Glamping y Eco Lodge","Hotel","Chalatenango","Miramundo",14.365,-89.118,"🌲","Boutique glamping and eco-lodge in the forests of Miramundo, Chalatenango, with glamping units and cabins for a peaceful mountain escape. Experiences include guided birdwatching, forest immersion, wellness retreats, meditation and Muay Thai training, subject to availability. Phone: +503 7809-0123. Published check-in: 2–6 PM; checkout before noon. Glamping units accommodate up to four guests, with a shared kitchen and dining area, private bathroom and hot shower. Pets are welcome for an additional fee. Forest trails, a river and waterfall, camping and a plant nursery are also advertised. Book through the official website and confirm rates, access directions and inclusions. Map marker is approximate for Miramundo.","Glamping boutique y eco-lodge en los bosques de Miramundo, Chalatenango, con alojamientos de glamping y cabañas para descansar en la montaña. Ofrece observación guiada de aves, contacto con el bosque, retiros de bienestar, meditación y entrenamiento de Muay Thai, según disponibilidad. Teléfono: +503 7809-0123. Entrada publicada: 2:00–6:00 p. m.; salida antes del mediodía. Los glampings tienen capacidad para hasta cuatro personas, cocina y comedor compartidos, baño privado y ducha caliente. Se admiten mascotas con cargo adicional. También se anuncian senderos, río y cascada, camping y vivero. Reserva en el sitio oficial y confirma tarifas, indicaciones de acceso e inclusiones. Marcador aproximado de Miramundo."],
[67,"Restaurante Las Palmeras — El Ferry","Restaurante Las Palmeras — El Ferry","Coffee / Food","Santa Ana","Lake Coatepeque",13.88353,-89.52557,"🌴","Lakeside family restaurant at Lake Coatepeque, known for its El Ferry boat experience. Enjoy food, drinks and lake views, with kayaking and private sailing trips advertised by the business. Reservations: +503 7581-3432. Confirm current opening hours, menus, activity prices and availability through Instagram before visiting. Map location is approximate.","Restaurante familiar a orillas del Lago de Coatepeque, conocido por la experiencia de paseo en El Ferry. Disfruta de comida, bebidas y vistas al lago; el negocio también anuncia kayak y paseos privados en velero. Reservas: +503 7581-3432. Confirma horarios vigentes, menú, precios y disponibilidad de actividades por Instagram antes de visitar. Ubicación aproximada en el mapa."],
[66,"Todo Azul Pacífico","Todo Azul Pacífico","Activity","La Libertad","Tamanique",13.599,-89.418,"🛶","Water-sports operator offering guided kayaking, stand-up paddleboarding and giant paddleboard wave rafting. Single, double and triple kayaks are available, with excursions accompanied by certified instructors. Service in Spanish, English and French. Registered address: Calle Principal, Lotificación Buenos Aires, Lote #1, Tamanique, La Libertad Costa. WhatsApp: +503 7278-7334. Email: todoazulpacifico@gmail.com. Book ahead and confirm prices, meeting point and conditions. Map marker is approximate for Tamanique; activities take place at different locations.","Operadora de deportes acuáticos con recorridos guiados en kayak, stand-up paddle y wave rafting en tabla gigante. Kayaks individuales, dobles y triples, con excursiones acompañadas por instructores certificados. Atención en español, inglés y francés. Dirección registrada: Calle Principal, Lotificación Buenos Aires, Lote #1, Tamanique, La Libertad Costa. WhatsApp: +503 7278-7334. Correo: todoazulpacifico@gmail.com. Reserva previamente y confirma tarifas, punto de encuentro y condiciones. Marcador aproximado de Tamanique; las actividades se realizan en distintos lugares."],
[65,"Laguna de Aramuaca","Laguna de Aramuaca","Water","San Miguel","San Miguel",13.43,-88.105,"🌅","Volcanic lagoon near San Miguel, between Cerro Bonito and Miraflores, with views of Chaparrastique volcano. Enjoy photography, sunsets, picnics and peaceful waterside scenery. A February 2026 report lists admission at $1 per person including parking; confirm locally. Opening hours and a direct contact number have not been verified. Map marker indicates the lagoon, not a confirmed entrance.","Laguna de origen volcánico cerca de San Miguel, entre Cerro Bonito y Miraflores, con vistas al volcán Chaparrastique. Ideal para fotografía, atardeceres, picnic y disfrutar del paisaje junto al agua. Un reportaje de febrero de 2026 indica entrada de $1 por persona con parqueo incluido; confirma la tarifa en el lugar. Horarios y teléfono de contacto no verificados. El marcador señala la laguna, no una entrada confirmada."],
[64,"Shah’s Kabob House","Shah’s Kabob House","Coffee / Food","San Salvador","Colonia Escalón",13.7042582,-89.2580289,"🍢","Family restaurant serving Afghan, Persian and Indian cuisine in Colonia Escalón. Address: Final Paseo General Escalón #63, San Salvador. Listed phone: +503 7786-4103. Reservation-platform hours: Monday closed; Tuesday–Wednesday 5–10 PM; Thursday–Friday 5–11 PM; Saturday noon–11 PM; Sunday noon–10 PM. Published hours differ across sources; confirm hours and contact details when reserving.","Restaurante familiar de cocina afgana, persa e india en la colonia Escalón. Dirección: Final Paseo General Escalón #63, San Salvador. Teléfono publicado: +503 7786-4103. Horario de la plataforma de reservas: lunes cerrado; martes y miércoles 5:00–10:00 p. m.; jueves y viernes 5:00–11:00 p. m.; sábado 12:00–11:00 p. m.; domingo 12:00–10:00 p. m. Los horarios publicados varían según la fuente; confirma horarios y datos de contacto al reservar."],
[63,"Mizata by Antiresort","Mizata by Antiresort","Hotel","La Libertad","Teotepeque",13.5109261,-89.5960962,"🌴","Beachfront surf and wellness hotel at Playa Mizata, with ocean and jungle treehouses, beachfront and jungle bungalows, and lodge rooms. Experiences include surfing, yoga, meditation, spa, sauna, cold plunge, horseback riding, dining and Nawi Beach House day passes. Package inclusions vary. Address: 15D Playa Mizata, Teotepeque, La Libertad Costa. Local phone: +503 2113-1758; international: +1 949-272-9281. Email: concierge@antiresort.com. Contact the hotel for rates, availability and day-pass conditions.","Hotel frente al mar para surf y bienestar en Playa Mizata, con casas en los árboles junto al océano y en la selva, bungalows y habitaciones tipo lodge. Ofrece experiencias de surf, yoga, meditación, spa, sauna, baños de agua fría, paseos a caballo, gastronomía y pases de día en Nawi Beach House. Las inclusiones varían según el paquete. Dirección: 15D Playa Mizata, Teotepeque, La Libertad Costa. Teléfono local: +503 2113-1758; internacional: +1 949-272-9281. Correo: concierge@antiresort.com. Consulta tarifas, disponibilidad y condiciones del pase de día directamente con el hotel."],
[62,"Tortuga Village","Tortuga Village","Hotel","La Paz","Costa del Sol",13.32768,-88.96725,"🏝️","Beachfront boutique hotel on Costa del Sol with thatched-roof bungalows, tropical gardens, pools, a restaurant, air conditioning, Wi-Fi and parking. Address: Boulevard Costa del Sol, km 66½, San Luis La Herradura, La Paz. Reservations: +503 2564-1777 / +503 2564-1778; WhatsApp: +503 2564-1777. Published check-in from 3 PM and checkout at 1 PM. Confirm rates, availability and arrival arrangements directly with the hotel.","Hotel boutique frente al mar en la Costa del Sol, con bungalows de techo de palma, jardines tropicales, piscinas, restaurante, aire acondicionado, Wi-Fi y estacionamiento. Dirección: Boulevard Costa del Sol, km 66½, San Luis La Herradura, La Paz. Reservas: +503 2564-1777 / +503 2564-1778; WhatsApp: +503 2564-1777. Entrada publicada desde las 3:00 p. m. y salida a la 1:00 p. m. Confirma tarifas, disponibilidad y condiciones de llegada directamente con el hotel."],
[61,"El Holandés Errante BBQ","El Holandés Errante BBQ","Coffee / Food","San Salvador","Colonia Escalón",13.704907894134521,-89.24475431442261,"🔥","Texas-style wood-smoked BBQ in Colonia Escalón, featuring brisket, pulled pork, ribs, pork belly, burgers and sandwiches, plus craft beers and cocktails. Outdoor seating, dog-friendly dining, takeout, delivery and event catering. Address: 3a Calle Poniente #4819, San Salvador. Phone: +503 7785-9304. Published hours: Monday closed; Tuesday 6–9:30 PM; Wednesday–Friday noon–2:30 PM and 6–9:30 PM; Saturday noon–9:30 PM; Sunday noon–4 PM. Confirm hours and current menu through the official links.","BBQ estilo Texas ahumado a leña en la colonia Escalón, con brisket, pulled pork, costillas, panceta, hamburguesas y sándwiches, además de cervezas artesanales y cócteles. Terraza, admite perros, comida para llevar, entrega a domicilio y catering para eventos. Dirección: 3a Calle Poniente #4819, San Salvador. Teléfono: +503 7785-9304. Horario publicado: lunes cerrado; martes 6:00–9:30 p. m.; miércoles a viernes 12:00–2:30 p. m. y 6:00–9:30 p. m.; sábado 12:00–9:30 p. m.; domingo 12:00–4:00 p. m. Confirma horarios y menú vigente en los enlaces oficiales."],
[60,"Los Chorros Recreational Park","Parque Recreativo Los Chorros","Water","La Libertad","Los Chorros",13.6952653,-89.3208969,"💦","Swim in four natural spring-fed pools surrounded by lush greenery at Los Chorros, approximately 18 km west of San Salvador. The park also has an outdoor amphitheater and accessible ramps. Open daily 8 AM–4 PM. Admission: Salvadorans $1.50; foreigners $3. Parking: light vehicles $1; heavy vehicles $2. Confirm current conditions and prices with ISTU before visiting.","Disfruta de cuatro piscinas de agua natural rodeadas de vegetación en Los Chorros, a unos 18 km al oeste de San Salvador. El parque también cuenta con un anfiteatro al aire libre y rampas inclusivas. Abierto todos los días de 8:00 a. m. a 4:00 p. m. Entrada: salvadoreños $1.50; extranjeros $3. Parqueo: vehículos livianos $1; pesados $2. Confirma condiciones y tarifas vigentes con ISTU antes de visitar."],
[59,"National Palace — Palacio Nacional","Palacio Nacional","Culture","San Salvador","Historic Center",13.6975,-89.19167,"🏛️","Explore the National Palace in San Salvador’s Historic Center, built between 1905 and 1911 and formerly home to the three branches of government. Discover its ornate Red, Blue, Pink and Yellow halls on a guided visit. Published hours: Tuesday–Sunday, 10 AM–midnight. Published admission: Salvadorans $1, foreign residents $3, nonresident foreigners $5. Confirm current hours, fees and exemptions through the official ticket website.","Explora el Palacio Nacional en el Centro Histórico de San Salvador, construido entre 1905 y 1911 y antigua sede de los tres poderes del Estado. Descubre sus elegantes salones Rojo, Azul, Rosado y Amarillo en un recorrido guiado. Horario publicado: martes a domingo, de 10:00 a. m. a medianoche. Tarifas publicadas: salvadoreños $1, extranjeros residentes $3 y no residentes $5. Confirma horarios, tarifas y exenciones vigentes en el sitio oficial de entradas."],
[58,"Ecoparque El Espino","Ecoparque El Espino","Nature","La Libertad","Antiguo Cuscatlán",13.70059,-89.27782,"🌳","Nature park near Ciudad Merliot offering easy-to-moderate forest walks, mountain biking, viewpoints and nature photography. Educational QR codes help visitors learn about local plants and wildlife. Address: 100 metres east of the Ciudad Merliot sports complex, at the end of Colonia La Sabana, Antiguo Cuscatlán, La Libertad. Open daily 5 AM–6 PM. Phones: +503 7437-1365 and +503 2131-5412. Contact the park for current entrance fees.","Parque natural cerca de Ciudad Merliot con senderos de dificultad fácil a moderada, ciclismo de montaña, miradores y fotografía de naturaleza. Los códigos QR educativos permiten conocer la flora y fauna local. Dirección: 100 metros al oriente del polideportivo de Ciudad Merliot, al final de la colonia La Sabana, Antiguo Cuscatlán, La Libertad. Abierto todos los días de 5:00 a. m. a 6:00 p. m. Teléfonos: +503 7437-1365 y +503 2131-5412. Consulta al parque la tarifa de entrada vigente."],
[23,"Republik Bar","Republik Bar","Bar / Club","San Salvador","San Benito",13.6930018,-89.2359963,"🎸","A popular live-music bar in Zona Rosa with food, drinks and rotating cover-band events. Check the current program and opening hours before going.","Popular bar de música en vivo en Zona Rosa, con comida, bebidas y eventos de bandas tributo. Confirma la programación y el horario antes de ir."],
[24,"Cadejo Brewing Company — Zona Rosa","Cadejo Brewing Company — Zona Rosa","Bar / Club","San Salvador","San Benito",13.6928,-89.2364,"🍺","Salvadoran craft brewery on Calle La Reforma with beer made on site, food and selected evening entertainment.","Cervecería artesanal salvadoreña en Calle La Reforma, con cerveza elaborada en el lugar, comida y entretenimiento nocturno en días seleccionados."],
[25,"Ceache Rooftop","Ceache Rooftop","Bar / Club","San Salvador","Historic Center",13.6978,-89.1915,"🍸","An elegant rooftop gastrobar with cocktails and panoramic views over San Salvador's Historic Center. Reservations and smart-casual dress are recommended.","Gastrobar elegante con coctelería y vistas panorámicas del Centro Histórico. Se recomienda reservar y vestir casual elegante."],
[26,"Superb Club","Superb Club","Bar / Club","San Salvador","San Salvador",13.6885,-89.2415,"💃","An adults-only dance club with DJs and late-night events. Confirm the event, reservation policy, cover charge and dress code before arrival.","Discoteca para mayores de edad con DJs y eventos nocturnos. Confirma el evento, reservación, cover y código de vestimenta antes de llegar."],
[27,"El Tunco Nightlife District","Zona nocturna de El Tunco","Bar / Club","La Libertad","El Tunco",13.4938,-89.3821,"🌙","A walkable beach-nightlife area with casual bars, music and weekend dancing. Venue schedules change frequently.","Zona nocturna junto a la playa con bares casuales, música y baile durante el fin de semana. Los horarios cambian con frecuencia."],
[28,"Hospital Nacional Rosales","Hospital Nacional Rosales","Medical","San Salvador","San Salvador",13.70056,-89.20667,"🏥","Major public national referral hospital. For urgent medical help, call the Medical Emergency System at 132. Confirm current services before traveling.","Principal hospital público nacional de referencia. Para asistencia médica urgente, llama al Sistema de Emergencias Médicas al 132. Confirma los servicios disponibles antes de trasladarte."],
[29,"Hospital de Diagnóstico — Escalón","Hospital de Diagnóstico — Escalón","Medical","San Salvador","Colonia Escalón",13.7045,-89.2375,"🩺","Private hospital in the Escalón area. Contact the facility or your travel insurer to confirm emergency care, specialists, costs and coverage.","Hospital privado en la zona Escalón. Contacta al centro o a tu aseguradora para confirmar emergencias, especialistas, costos y cobertura."],
[30,"San Juan de Dios National Hospital — Santa Ana","Hospital Nacional San Juan de Dios — Santa Ana","Medical","Santa Ana","Santa Ana",13.99297,-89.55045,"🏥","Regional public hospital serving western El Salvador. Call 132 for urgent medical assistance and confirm the appropriate entrance on arrival.","Hospital público regional que atiende el occidente de El Salvador. Llama al 132 para asistencia médica urgente y confirma la entrada correspondiente al llegar."],
[31,"San Juan de Dios Regional Hospital — San Miguel","Hospital Regional San Juan de Dios — San Miguel","Medical","San Miguel","San Miguel",13.4864,-88.1816,"🏥","Regional public referral hospital for eastern El Salvador. Services and access points may change; call 132 in a medical emergency.","Hospital público regional de referencia para el oriente de El Salvador. Los servicios y accesos pueden cambiar; llama al 132 en una emergencia médica."],
[32,"Dr. Héctor Antonio Hernández Flores National Hospital","Hospital Nacional Dr. Héctor Antonio Hernández Flores","Medical","Morazán","San Francisco Gotera",13.69782,-88.10214,"🏥","Public hospital serving Morazán from Avenida Thomson Norte. Call 132 for urgent medical help and verify available services.","Hospital público que atiende Morazán desde la avenida Thomson Norte. Llama al 132 para asistencia urgente y verifica los servicios disponibles."],
[33,"Puerto de La Libertad Community Health Unit","Unidad Comunitaria de Salud Familiar Puerto de La Libertad","Medical","La Libertad","La Libertad",13.4883,-89.3222,"🩺","Public primary-care facility near the coast. It is not a substitute for a full emergency hospital; call 132 for urgent medical assistance.","Centro público de atención primaria cerca de la costa. No sustituye a un hospital de emergencias; llama al 132 para asistencia médica urgente."],
[34,"Bitcoin Beach — El Zonte","Bitcoin Beach — El Zonte","Bitcoin","La Libertad","El Zonte",13.4938,-89.4393,"₿","The community where El Salvador’s Bitcoin movement began. Some local businesses accept Bitcoin or Lightning, but acceptance is voluntary and can change. Ask before ordering and keep USD as a backup. Last reviewed: September 2026.","La comunidad donde comenzó el movimiento Bitcoin de El Salvador. Algunos negocios aceptan Bitcoin o Lightning, pero la aceptación es voluntaria y puede cambiar. Pregunta antes de ordenar y lleva dólares como respaldo. Última revisión: septiembre de 2026."],
[35,"Punta Roca Surf Break","Ola de Punta Roca","Surf","La Libertad","La Libertad",13.4833,-89.3196,"🏄","World-class powerful right point break over a rocky bottom. Best for advanced and expert surfers; consult local guides about tides, entry and current conditions.","Potente point break de derecha de clase mundial sobre fondo rocoso. Recomendado para surfistas avanzados y expertos; consulta a guías locales sobre mareas, entrada y condiciones."],
[36,"El Sunzal Surf Break","Ola de El Sunzal","Surf","La Libertad","Tamanique",13.4940,-89.4050,"🏄‍♀️","A long right point break popular with intermediate surfers. Conditions vary; beginners should enter only with a qualified local instructor.","Point break largo de derecha popular entre surfistas intermedios. Las condiciones cambian; los principiantes deben entrar únicamente con un instructor local calificado."],
[37,"El Tunco Surf Break","Ola de El Tunco","Surf","La Libertad","El Tunco",13.4935,-89.3825,"🏄","A lively surf base with access to different nearby breaks, board rentals and lessons. Ask a surf school which break matches your level that day.","Animada base de surf con acceso a diferentes olas cercanas, alquiler de tablas y clases. Pregunta en una escuela qué ola corresponde a tu nivel ese día."],
[38,"El Zonte Surf Break","Ola de El Zonte","Surf","La Libertad","El Zonte",13.4935,-89.4398,"🏄‍♂️","A well-known surf community with several wave options. Beginners should book a lesson; rocky sections and changing swell require local advice.","Reconocida comunidad surfista con varias opciones de olas. Los principiantes deben reservar una clase; las zonas rocosas y el oleaje cambiante requieren orientación local."],
[39,"Las Flores Surf Break","Ola de Las Flores","Surf","San Miguel","Chirilagua",13.1702,-88.1045,"🌊","A high-quality right point break on the eastern coast, generally suited to intermediate and advanced surfers. Check swell and access locally.","Point break de derecha de gran calidad en la costa oriental, generalmente apto para surfistas intermedios y avanzados. Confirma el oleaje y acceso localmente."],
[40,"Punta Mango Surf Break","Ola de Punta Mango","Surf","Usulután","Jucuarán",13.1670,-88.0350,"🌊","A remote, demanding rocky wave reserved for experienced surfers on stronger days. Arrange transport and local guidance before visiting.","Ola rocosa, remota y exigente, reservada para surfistas experimentados en días fuertes. Organiza transporte y guía local antes de visitarla."]
